cal{C}\\subseteq\\mathcal P(P)\">\\(\\mathcal{C}\\subseteq\\mathcal P(P)\\)</span> (cover family)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathcal{C}\">\\(A\\in\\mathcal{C}\\)</span> (antichain member bound in the assertion)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Poset},\\mathrm{Antichain}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Poset},\\mathrm{Antichain}_S\\)</span> (source predicates)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcOrder10AntichainCover}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcOrder10AntichainCover}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order10\\text{-}antichain\\text{-}cover} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcOrder10AntichainCover}_S(\\mathcal C,P,\\leq_P)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq_P)\\land\\mathcal C\\subseteq\\mathcal P(P)\\land\\bigcup\\mathcal C=P\\land\\forall A\\in\\mathcal C\\;\\mathrm{Antichain}_S(A,P,\\leq_P)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order10\\text{-}antichain\\text{-}cover} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcOrder10AntichainCover}_S(\\mathcal C,P,\\leq_P)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq_P)\\land\\mathcal C\\subseteq\\mathcal P(P)\\land\\bigcup\\mathcal C=P\\land\\forall A\\in\\mathcal C\\;\\mathrm{Antichain}_S(A,P,\\leq_P)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The cover is typed as a family of subsets, and antichainhood uses the exact sourced signature.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58